{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/6044cfe7abe702dd0239cf73be27432e.webp?t=1758845257\" width=648 height=39 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROBO SHAM BORO  </strong>is a rock paper scissors deckbuilder card battler JRPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as this guy named Dillinger, a spry young man caught up in the biggest conspiracy this side of the Old Road. People found dead in dumpsters and house parties, killer robots on the loose, talks of summoning a beast in the woods..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right, there's murder afoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it <i>might</i> have been a murder. We're not totally sure. It could have just been a heart attack, or like a bear or something. But it could have also been a murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyways, smart guy, I know that it's December 25th and all, but could you on a wacky adventure full of personal growth and rock and paper and scissors to figure this one out for us? I'm sure you've got nothing else going on. It's not like anything else happens today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.poster.avif?t=1758845257\" width=524 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.webm?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.mp4?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of <strong>ROBO SHAM BORO</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270a Rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270c\ufe0f Scissors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.poster.avif?t=1758845257\" width=718 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.webm?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.mp4?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, you heard me right, bitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got\u00a0\u270a Rock,\u00a0\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Paper, <i>AND</i>\u00a0\u270c\ufe0f Scissors. Play your cards right, because every time you do your sign changes to match it. You'll have to play smart and manage your resources to avoid opening yourself up to deadly crits and dish out some of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>But I'm not done yet! </i>More features of <strong>ROBO SHAM BORO:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf DECKBUILDING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.poster.avif?t=1758845257\" width=674 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.webm?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.mp4?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your deck's full of random shit or something resembling an actual build, it's on you to collect the right cards and stack the deck in your favor to come out on top. The game's got a good deal of depth to it, and the right answer won't always come down to rock beating scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Nothing is stopping you from bringing 30 \ud83d\udd90\ufe0fMysteries, though. Do it. Don't be a coward.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But get this, there's even more to this game! Like:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.poster.avif?t=1758845257\" width=614 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.webm?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.mp4?t=1758845257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorry that's all I got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, man, the screenshots speak for themself. If this doesn't look like the kind of game you'd enjoy, you probably won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/e